  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lab 100 ORGANIZATIONAL RULES\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #5235, effective 9-27-91, made extensive changes to the wording, format, structure, and numbering of rules in Part Lab 101. Document #5235 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in this part. The prior filings for former Part Lab 101 include the following documents:\n\n#2264, eff 1-6-83\n\n#2935, eff 12-27-84; EXPIRED 12-27-90",
